    "body": "Closing this as a duplicate of #59339. We left it open for a day in case it turned out to be a different problem, and there's been no reply since.\n\nThe repeated `skill` calls with `{\"id\": \"general\"}` happen because v2 has no repeated-tool-call (`doom_loop`) detection yet, and that's what #59339 tracks. Please follow it there, along with the open PR #53032. The mix-up between the `general` agent and a skill id is tracked in #46568.\n\nThanks again for the report, @RoboXGamer. If you think this is a different problem, reply here and we can reopen it.\n\n<!-- opencode-github-bot:reply:msg_938b81402e2e9e72d4356bc1750c32d52dc5e0629e4bac02247c355866ec28ba:closing -->",
